    (uuid d9e29421-63a1-4b40-8c6c-664fbf3406d4)
  )
  (text "transfer IFLDAJ to IFLD\nFETCH of JMS/JMP opcode is old IFLD\nDEFER of JMS/JMS is with old IFLD\nEXEC of JMS is with new IFLD\n- during TP3\n  memory writeback is complete using old IFLD\n  current major state is stable\n- must be doing JMS or JMP\n- FETCH with direct addressing or DEFER"
    (at 302.26 50.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid dc524e9c-d913-4f28-befc-d935cb71cc8e)
  )
  (text "62x1 opcode\n- load 'x'" (at 330.2 110.49 0)
